# Activity 2: Personal Branding

## 📝 Description
Created a personal branding kit for Dot & Flash, featuring a brand name, logo, tagline, color palette, and typography to establish a consistent visual identity.

## 💡 What Have I Learned?
Through this activity, I learned how to develop a brand identity by choosing elements that reflect the personality and purpose of a brand. I realized that having a consistent logo, colors, fonts, and tagline helps make a brand more recognizable and memorable. I also learned the importance of creativity and consistency in building a strong brand that stands out.
